# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

# Environment variables — Supabase URL + anon key live here.
# Never commit a real .env; .env.example holds the template only.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Capacitor iOS — Xcode artefacts that shouldn't be committed.
# The ios/App/App project itself is fine to commit (Capacitor
# regenerates it on `npx cap add ios`, but committing lets you
# track Info.plist edits, app icons, etc.).
ios/App/Pods
ios/App/build
ios/App/DerivedData
ios/App/App/public
ios/.DS_Store

# Editor directories and files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?
